.TH MUSAEUS 1 "October 2026" "MUSAEUS 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
musaeus \- music library pipeline
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B musaeus
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
MUSAEUS ingests and catalogs audio, measures loudness, writes tags, and
builds selected library exports. It uses a per-user vault configured through
.BR "musaeus setup" .
A real pipeline run can move and retag files. Keep a backup before using it.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B setup
Configure the vault path and optional integration credentials.
.TP
.B run --dry-run
Show a read-only plan for the configured vault.
.TP
.B run
Run the pipeline against the configured vault.
.TP
.B status
Show library status.
.TP
.B --help
List all commands and options.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/musaeus/settings.env
.br
.I ~/.config/musaeus/credentials.env
.SH SEE ALSO
Project documentation: https://github.com/BogMan64/musaeus
